### Get all courses
GET http://localhost:8080/courses

### Get one course by id
GET http://localhost:8080/courses/2

### Create a new course
POST http://localhost:8080/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "CSCI 3120",
  "name": "Operating Systems",
  "instructor": "TBD"
}

### Update an existing course
PUT http://localhost:8080/courses/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "code": "CSCI 3120",
  "name": "Operating Systems",
  "instructor": "Smith"
}

### Delete a course
DELETE http://localhost:8080/courses/4

### Get all students
GET http://localhost:8080/students

### Create a student
POST http://localhost:8080/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Jordan Lee",
  "email": "jordan@dal.ca"
}

### Enroll student 1 in course 1
POST http://localhost:8080/students/1/enroll/1

### Get all students (see the enrollment)
GET http://localhost:8080/students